## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (2)
- `GET /api/a11y-data/v0/page/{pageToken}/DESKTOP/WIDGET_ON/status` — Check accessibility status for a page widget.
- `GET /video/upload/{uploadId}/v1/video-attachments/generic_asset/asset/{assetToken}/{assetToken}` — Get video attachment details using asset tokens.

### Data Read (5)
- `GET /action/0` — Retrieve data from the /action/0 endpoint.
- `GET /chv` — Retrieve data from the /chv endpoint.
- `GET /timeline/v2/jsonp/1` — Retrieve timeline data in JSONP format.
- `GET /v3/gtm_stats/count/onetrust.loaded/1` — Get the count of 'onetrust.loaded' events.
- `GET /widgetapp/{widgetappDate}/locales/en-US.json` — Retrieve locale-specific data for a widget application.

### Data Write (11)
- `POST /{id}` — Update data associated with a specific ID.
- `POST /actionp/0` — Submit data to the /actionp/0 endpoint.
- `POST /api/v1/activities` — Record a user activity event.
- `POST /api/v1/PXK3bezZfO/d/p` — Submit data to a specific endpoint.
- `POST /api/v1/tunings/4kGZ0fioo4` — Submit tuning data for a specific configuration.
- `POST /api/v3/data/` — Submit data to the /api/v3/data/ endpoint.
- `POST /bianka/api/v1/activity` — Record an activity event via Bianka API.
- `POST /recommendations/personalized_content` — Request personalized content recommendations.
- `POST /v1/ingest` — Ingest data into the system.
- `POST /v3/relay` — Relay data through the /v3/relay endpoint.
- `POST /WRSiteInterceptEngine/Targeting.php` — Submit targeting data for website interception.

### Media (1)
- `POST /assets/js/bundle` — Upload a Javascript bundle.

### Config (1)
- `GET /v1/config/{configHash}` — Retrieve a specific configuration based on its hash.

